# Hairpin 0: a bobby pin in dark bronze, 1.5 m long and 0.3 m wide (30 times life size, a 5 cm pin), two legs joined by a round bend, one leg crimped.
# Lying flat on the floor, the bend at +z. Ground clutter: no collider.
format 1

